	(text "Sized for 10 A (about 7.5 A continuous): fans and pump up to 4.2 A plus the I/O. F1 is a backup only: add an inline high-breaking-capacity fuse at the PSU end. Reverse polarity: the TVS forward-clamps and blows the fuse."
